   "k": "f8pxoq",
   "en": "The Imperial Influence system is set up as a points system. In 1936, the army starts with 20 points, the navy starts with 15 points, the Zaibatsu start with 15 points, and the Civic Faction starts with 10 points."
  },
  {
   "k": "639gfr",
   "en": "There are four tiers of influence. From the lowest tier to the highest: Subdued, Meddling, Influential and Dominating. There can only be one Dominating faction at a time."
  },
  {
   "k": "1f0z5dk",
   "en": "Generally, for small influence increases, the faction gains 5 points. For large influence increases, the faction gains 10 points."
  },
  {
   "k": "12dmqrp",
   "en": "For a small increase, the game checks if the faction level is less than the variable ⟦0⟧ which is 40 points. Then, for each tier below Dominating, the game checks if the faction's points are below a certain number. If it's below, it only gains 5 points. Otherwise, it increases in tier and then gains the points. The values required for an increase in tiers is as follows: Subdued to Meddling requires 5 points, Meddling to Influential requires 20 points, Influential to Dominating requires 35 points. Then if there is a faction that is already Dominating, it will then be demoted to Influential and will be set to 35 points.",
   "frags": 1
  },
  {
   "k": "1ev5s11",
   "en": "JAP_tier_4_minimum_limit"
  },
  {
   "k": "1xvbp8j",
   "en": "For a large increase, the game does a similar check as the small increase, however the points required to increase tiers are different. Subdued to Meddling will automatically go up, Meddling to Influential requires 15 points, Influential to Dominating requires 30 points. It will then gain 10 points. Similarly, if there is a faction that is already Dominating, it will then be demoted to Influential and will be set to 35 points."
  },
  {
   "k": "14tezyf",
   "en": "For a small decrease, the game checks if the faction level is less than the variable ⟦0⟧ which is 0 points. Then, for each tier above Subdued, the game checks if the faction's points are above a certain number. if it is above, it only loses 5 points. Otherwise, it decreases in tier and then loses the points. The values required for a decrease in tiers is as follows: Dominating to Influential requires 44 points, Influential to Meddling requires 29 points, Meddling to Subdued requires 14 points.",
   "frags": 1
  },
  {
   "k": "10uh4ux",
   "en": "JAP_minimum_faction_level"
  },
  {
   "k": "gmumla",
   "en": "For a large decrease, the game checks if the faction level is more than the variable ⟦0⟧ which is 9 points. If it is below 9 points, it only loses 5 points. If it is above 9 points, for each tier above Subdued, the game checks if the faction's points are above a certain number. If it is not above, it then gets demoted if it is not above a certain point limit. The values required for a decrease in tiers is as follows: Dominating to Influential requires 49 points, Influential to Meddling requires 34 points, Meddling to Subdued requires 19 points. It then loses 10 points.",
   "frags": 1
  },
  {
